  "details": "Navigation is unreliable for Groups Activity/Instances.\n\nPreparation:\n\nPut \"Profile\" on a sidewing in MM\n\nReproduce:\n\n1. Open QM\n\n2. Click Groups-Button\n\n3. In Group Activity Tab, choose any instnace\n\n4. In Sidewing, Click on Status\n\n5. Close/Update Status\n\n6. Close MM\n\n7. Open QM\n\n8. Click Groups-Button\n\nExpected Behaviour:\n\nAs in step 3: I'm looking at the Group Activity Tab\n\nCurrent Behaviour:\n\nI'm looking at the instance i choosed in Step 3.\n\nFollow up Bug:\n\n9. Clicking on an Instance in a side wing after step 8, makes the \"<-\" Button non-functional",
